00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:58.040
Oh, you brought a wolf... Please keep it outside.

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:00.790
Haimaki... is a dog... A dog...

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:03.170
Yes, yes, dogs aren't allowed either.

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:05.130
I wonder what's happening...

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:07.180
I wonder too...

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:32.660
Genkai made girigiri no Distance

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:32.660
This distance is barely below my limit

00:22:34.660 --> 00:22:39.000
Itsudatte hitori hashitta

00:22:34.660 --> 00:22:39.000
I always ran all of it alone

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:44.960
Ashitematoi sou omou nara

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:44.960
If you think that I am a hindrance

00:22:47.220 --> 00:22:52.970
Ma ni au wa ima naraba hikikaeseba ii

00:22:47.220 --> 00:22:52.970
There is still time, just turn back now

00:22:53.510 --> 00:22:56.770
Sayonara ni wa narete ita

00:22:53.510 --> 00:22:56.770
I was used to saying goodbye

00:22:57.230 --> 00:23:00.690
Ano hi deau made

00:22:57.230 --> 00:23:00.690
Until the day we met

00:23:03.060 --> 00:23:06.230
Kimi wo mamoritai

00:23:03.060 --> 00:23:06.230
"I want to protect you"

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:14.030
Hajimete kiita sono kotoba wo

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:14.030
I'd never heard those words before

00:23:15.490 --> 00:23:20.290
Zutto zutto matte ita ki ga shita

00:23:15.490 --> 00:23:20.290
I feel that I've always been waiting for them

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:26.800
Shinjitai yo

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:26.800
I want to believe

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:29.510
What will be the final

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:33.600
Kameria no me de

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:33.600
In these camelia eyes?
